  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BioEcoOcean: Co-Creating Transformative Pathways to Biological and Ecosystem Ocean Observations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BioEcoOcean project aims to change how we study the ocean and promote sustainable use. We&apos;ll work with diverse stakeholders to create a Blueprint for Integrated Ocean Science (BIOS) adhering to FAIR Data Principles. We&apos;ll collect data and develop models for BioEco Essential Ocean Variables (EOVs), collaborate with global ocean observation initiatives, and prioritize capacity building. The project will impact and strengthen ocean and biodiversity observation and management at all levels.</narrative>
  </description>
